19. Major Business Challenge #3 — Medicine Expiry

Problem

Pharmaceutical products have finite shelf lives.

Slow-moving inventory creates the possibility of expiry-related financial losses.

Data Analyst Solution

Build an expiry-risk dashboard containing:

- Batch number
- Manufacturing date
- Expiry date
- Current stock
- Average monthly sales
- Days of inventory
- Expiry risk

Recommended alert levels

Green: Normal

Amber: Monitor

Red: Immediate action required

Expected impact

Reduced expiry losses and improved inventory turnover.

